# GGMI Mexico: Media Budget Reduction Proposal

**Entity:** GGMI, GAIN Global Markets Inc. (Mexico, forex.com/es)  
**Prepared for:** FOREX.com  
**Prepared by:** brlvnt  
**Date:** August 27, 2026  
**Measured against:** Approved August 2026 monthly budget by channel, $125,000 across the four live channels (FOREX.com tracker, last updated 08/06/2026)  
**Status:** DRAFT for FOREX.com review. Not for distribution.

---

## 1. Recommendation

brlvnt recommends the **Controlled Pullback: $61,000 a month, a 51% reduction against the approved $125,000.** It holds application volume close to flat while removing half the budget.

A **Deep Pullback at $33,500**, a 73% reduction, is the alternative if cash preservation outweighs volume.

Hold the chosen level through September and October. Decide on ramping back up in the first half of October.

| Line | Approved | Controlled Pullback | Deep Pullback |
|---|---:|---:|---:|
| Bing | $30,000 | **$25,000** | **$18,500** |
| Azerion | $35,000 | **$25,000** | **$15,000** |
| Quantcast | $35,000 | $11,000 | $0 |
| Native | $25,000 | $0 | $0 |
