The Controlled Pullback produces close to the same number of applications for half the money, because every dollar removed comes from Azerion at $978 an application, or from Native and Quantcast, which report none.

Two cautions. This holds each cost per application constant, and Bing's rose from about $237 to $379 as it scaled through August, so a further increase may raise it again. Azerion at a lower weight may not hold $978 either. Treat the counts as sizing, not a forecast.

